  "description": [
    {
      "ja": "『機動戦士ガンダム 逆襲のシャア』に登場するヤクト・ドーガ（ギュネイ・ガス機）が、RE/100で登場！",
      "en": "Yakut Doga (Gyunei Gas Machine) that appears in \"Mobile Suit Gundam: Char's Counterattack\" is now available in RE/100!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 特徴的なデザインを、MGシリーズに比肩する造形で実現！",
      "en": "• Achieving a distinctive design with a shape comparable to the MG series!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 劇中のイメージを踏襲しながらも、密度感を高める為に細かなディテールが追加されている！",
      "en": "• While following the image in the play, small details have been added to increase the sense of density!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• サブスラスターのファンネルはすべて個別に取り外しができ、展開ギミックも搭載！",
      "en": "• All the sub-thruster funnels can be removed individually, and it also has an expansion gimmick!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• さらに展開状態のファンネル6基すべてをディスプレイできるクリア支柱が付属！",
      "en": "• In addition, a clear support is included to display all 6 funnels in the expanded state!"
    }
  ],
